   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the tax law, in relation to imposing an additional one percent\noccupancy tax in the city of Lockport, Niagara County to be dedicated to the\noperation of the Discover Niagara Shuttle",
    "basePrintNo": "S2080",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S2080-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §1202-o, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S2080\n\nSPONSOR: ORTT\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the tax law, in relation to imposing an additional one\npercent occupancy tax in the city of Lockport, Niagara County to be\ndedicated to the operation of the Discover Niagara Shuttle\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis legislation imposes an additional 1% bed tax on rooms located with-\nin the City of Lockport and dedicates these funds to the Discover\nNiagara Shuttle.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 imposes an additional 1% bed tax on rooms located within Lock-\nport and dedicates these funds to the Discover Niagara Shuttle.\n\nSection 2 is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation which is at the request of the municipality would\nincrease the local bed tax by 1% with all proceeds being dedicated to\nenhancing and expanding the Discover Niagara shuttle. Startling around\nMemorial Day 7 days a week the Discover Niagara Shuttle runs between\n9am-6pm making stops about every 30-35 minutes and on weekends, roughly\nevery 45-60 minutes from 6pm-midnight. The shuttle currently operates in\nNiagara Falls, Lewiston and Youngstown. This additional revenue will\nallow the shuttle to operate more frequently and expand the number of\nstops it makes, including into Lockport.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2017-2018: S. 8420 referred to Investigations and Government Operations.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNONE TO THE STATE.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect on the first day of the month next succeed-\ning.\n",
